
3.2. Liệt kê khóa chính và khóa ngoại của các thực thể
| STT | Thực thể            | Khóa chính (PK)  | Khóa ngoại (FK)    | Tham chiếu                      |
| --: | ------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------- |
|   1 | **ROLE**            | `role_id`        | –                  | –                               |
|   2 | **USER**            | `user_id`        | –                  | –                               |
|   3 | **USER_ROLE**       | `user_role_id`   | `user_id_fk`       | `USER(user_id)`                 |
|     |                     |                  | `role_id_fk`       | `ROLE(role_id)`                 |
|   4 | **SITE**            | `site_id`        | –                  | –                               |
|   5 | **ROOM**            | `room_id`        | `site_id_fk`       | `SITE(site_id)`                 |
|   6 | **RACK**            | `rack_id`        | `room_id_fk`       | `ROOM(room_id)`                 |
|   7 | **SERVER**          | `server_id`      | `rack_id_fk`       | `RACK(rack_id)`                 |
|   8 | **CONTAINER**       | `container_id`   | `server_id_fk`     | `SERVER(server_id)`             |
|   9 | **WARRANTY**        | `warranty_id`    | `server_id_fk`     | `SERVER(server_id)`             |
|  10 | **TELEMETRY**       | `telemetry_id`   | `server_id_fk`     | `SERVER(server_id)`             |
|  11 | **ALERT_THRESHOLD** | `threshold_id`   | `server_id_fk`     | `SERVER(server_id)`             |
|  12 | **ALERT**           | `alert_id`       | `server_id_fk`     | `SERVER(server_id)`             |
|     |                     |                  | `threshold_id_fk`  | `ALERT_THRESHOLD(threshold_id)` |
|  13 | **INCIDENT**        | `incident_id`    | `alert_id_fk`      | `ALERT(alert_id)`               |
|  14 | **TICKET**          | `ticket_id`      | `incident_id_fk`   | `INCIDENT(incident_id)`         |
|     |                     |                  | `assigned_to_fk`   | `USER(user_id)`                 |
|     |                     |                  | `created_by_fk`    | `USER(user_id)`                 |
|  15 | **MAINTENANCE**     | `maintenance_id` | `ticket_id_fk`     | `TICKET(ticket_id)`             |
|     |                     |                  | `technician_id_fk` | `USER(user_id)`                 |
|  16 | **AUDIT_LOG**       | `audit_log_id`   | `user_id_fk`       | `USER(user_id)`                 |

3.3. Liệt kê các Constraint của thực thể (NOT NULL, NULL, UNIQUE, DEFAULT, CHECK)
3.3.1. ROLE
role_name: NOT NULL, UNIQUE.
description: NULL.  
3.3.2. USER
username: NOT NULL, UNIQUE.
password_hash: NOT NULL.
full_name: NOT NULL.
email: NOT NULL, UNIQUE.
status: NOT NULL, DEFAULT 'Inactive'.  
3.3.3. USER_ROLE
user_id_fk, role_id_fk: UNIQUE (Đảm bảo một vai trò không được gán trùng cho cùng một người dùng).
Các cột khóa ngoại (user_id_fk, role_id_fk): NOT NULL.  
3.3.4. SITE
site_name: NOT NULL, UNIQUE.
location: NOT NULL.  
3.3.5. ROOM
room_name: NOT NULL.
site_id_fk: NOT NULL.  
3.3.6. RACK
rack_name: NOT NULL.
room_id_fk: NOT NULL.  
3.3.7. SERVER
server_name: NOT NULL, UNIQUE.
ip_address: NOT NULL, UNIQUE.
operating_system: NOT NULL.
status: NOT NULL, DEFAULT 'Inactive'.
rack_id_fk: NOT NULL.  
3.3.8. CONTAINER
container_name: NOT NULL.
container_type: NULL.
status: NOT NULL, DEFAULT 'Inactive'.
server_id_fk: NOT NULL.  
3.3.9. WARRANTY
provider: NOT NULL.
warranty_start: NOT NULL.
warranty_end: NOT NULL.
status: NOT NULL.
server_id_fk: NOT NULL, UNIQUE.  
3.3.10. TELEMETRY
cpu_usage: NOT NULL.
ram_usage: NOT NULL.
disk_usage: NOT NULL.
network_usage: NULL.
temperature: NULL.
recorded_at: NOT NULL.
server_id_fk: NOT NULL.  
3.3.11. ALERT_THRESHOLD
metric_name: NOT NULL.
warning_value: NOT NULL.
critical_value: NOT NULL.
is_active: NOT NULL, DEFAULT 1.
server_id_fk: NOT NULL.  
3.3.12. ALERT
alert_type: NOT NULL.
severity: NOT NULL.
description: NULL.
status: NOT NULL, DEFAULT 'OPEN'.
created_at: NOT NULL.
server_id_fk: NOT NULL.  
3.3.13. INCIDENT
incident_title: NOT NULL.
description: NULL.
priority: NOT NULL.
status: NOT NULL, DEFAULT 'OPEN'.
created_at: NOT NULL.
alert_id_fk: NOT NULL.  
3.3.14. TICKET
ticket_title: NOT NULL.
description: NULL.
priority: NOT NULL.
status: NOT NULL, DEFAULT 'OPEN'.
created_at: NOT NULL.
incident_id_fk: NOT NULL.
assigned_user_id_fk: NOT NULL.  
3.3.15. MAINTENANCE
maintenance_type: NOT NULL.
description: NULL.
performed_at: NOT NULL.
result: NULL.
ticket_id_fk: NOT NULL.  
3.3.16. AUDIT_LOG
action: NOT NULL.
entity_type: NOT NULL.
entity_id: NULL.
description: NULL.
created_at: NOT NULL.
user_id_fk: NULL.

